","kind":"person","person_id":"k4e_7j3_ijr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m041-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"子産","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m041-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"鄭君","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m041-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"子産","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m041-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"k4e_7j3_ijr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m041-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"齊慶封","kind":"person","person_id":"830_x2v_h3v","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p042","text":"三十六年，簡公卒，子定公寧立。秋，定公朝晉昭公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m042-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m042-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"定公寧","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m042-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m042-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"晉昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"5bx_zam_t0r","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p060","text":"厲王之子，得封於鄭。代職司徒，緇衣在詠。虢、鄶獻邑，祭祝專命。莊既犯王，厲亦奔命。居櫟克入，夢蘭毓慶。伯服生囚，叔瞻屍聘。釐、簡之後，公室不競。負黍雖還，韓哀日盛。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witne